### =========================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/body-metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heightCm": 170.0,
  "bodyFatPercent": 22.5,
  "muscleMassKg": 30.2,
  "note": "Test thiếu cân nặng"
}


